<section class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">Still working on shipping Companion modules</div>
  <h1>Hi, I'm Zack!</h1>
  <p class="tagline">
    Software developer and production engineer building tools for live events.
  </p>
  <p class="bio">
    I work at <strong>Hope Church</strong> in Richmond, VA, making services hum and
    creating a special place for students to belong and be themselves. Software development,
    building automation, and 3D printing somehow fall into "other duties as assigned."
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 76px 0 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    font-weight: 500;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--teal);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--teal-tint);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 58px;
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .tagline {
    font-size: 21px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .bio {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 0 44px;
  }
  .bio strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
